# SHA-256 of the training streams this module bundles, each a copy of a pinned test vector of another module:
# exr: image's OpenEXR vectors (tools/testdata/behavior/make-exr-vectors.py, OpenEXR 3.5.2, exr.sha256);
# jxr: image's JPEG XR vectors (tools/testdata/behavior/make-jxr-vectors.py, jxrlib 1.1 JxrEncApp, jxr.tsv);
# h263: mpeg's H.263 annex streams (tools/testdata/h263-annexes/make-vectors.py, TMN 3.2 and h263enc.py, golden.tsv);
# h264: mpeg's separate color plane streams (JM, video/h264/chroma444/streams.tsv);
# usac: mpeg's USAC fuzz seeds (libxaac's encoder; usac-tw-lpd: UsacTestStream, FuzzSeedWriter.usacTimeWarped;
# MpegFuzzTestInputs/aac/valid-usac-*.bin).
